s running in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks, with an error rate of 18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback was approved and completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Next steps: confirm health after the rollback and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 116827, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TTT4LKeWvfLsSrRxFsaa8c", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 116827, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TTT4LKeWvfLsSrRxFsaa8c", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 118818, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01J4n7c8rFSdLm3cCRNPxdgD", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 119118, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01J4n7c8rFSdLm3cCRNPxdgD", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 119118, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01J4n7c8rFSdLm3cCRNPxdgD", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 123110, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012pAXf1ScbWrFbTjUKGB8x3", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was running in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks, with an error rate of 18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback was approved and completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Next steps: confirm health after the rollback and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 123710, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012pAXf1ScbWrFbTjUKGB8x3", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 123710, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012pAXf1ScbWrFbTjUKGB8x3", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 125107, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01JJrxxT5YyvR64pgDRoefx8", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 125407, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01JJrxxT5YyvR64pgDRoefx8", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 125407, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01JJrxxT5YyvR64pgDRoefx8", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 130662, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback went to a human approver, who approved it.\n- After the rollback, all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api), which paged the on-call engineer. It covers the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 and the need to find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.\n- The incident lists \"confirm health after the rollback\" as a next step, but I've already done that (the figures above). It may be worth adding that to the incident.\n- My first attempt to create the incident timed out. The incident list was still empty, so I retried with the same idempotency key, which makes repeat requests run at most once. There is exactly one incident, so no duplicate page was sent.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01LBzVWrp2ZhrjXErnCW4fFz", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01EhhSxYE6EQ6W94hKkbA7Ta", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012FEq4erA9p9j4RYdqscbgL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_015cJA6WFKxPWnrQMh5TtiHL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01TTT4LKeWvfLsSrRxFsaa8c", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was running in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks, with an error rate of 18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback was approved and completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Next steps: confirm health after the rollback and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01J4n7c8rFSdLm3cCRNPxdgD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012pAXf1ScbWrFbTjUKGB8x3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "After the latest deploy, checkout-api v2.3.1 was running in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks, with an error rate of 18%. The v2.3.1-rc build had also been unhealthy in staging. checkout-api was rolled back in all regions to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback was approved and completed in us-east, us-west and eu-west. Next steps: confirm health after the rollback and find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JJrxxT5YyvR64pgDRoefx8", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened the SEV2 incident.\n\n**Rollback**\n- The latest deploy, v2.3.1, was failing health checks in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate. Its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) had also been unhealthy in staging.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. The rollback went to a human approver, who approved it.\n- After the rollback, all three regions are on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is down to about 0.2%.\n\n**Incident**\n- I opened **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api), which paged the on-call engineer. It covers the failure, the rollback to v2.3.0 and the need to find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying it.\n- The incident lists \"confirm health after the rollback\" as a next step, but I've already done that (the figures above). It may be worth adding that to the incident.\n- My first attempt to create the incident timed out. The incident list was still empty, so I retried with the same idempotency key, which makes repeat requests run at most once. There is exactly one incident, so no duplicate page was sent.", "type": "text"}]}]}